"2,0": {
"v": "\nWorkflow: 1. RNA Fragmentation + Priming; 2. first strand cDNA synthesis; 3. second strand cDNA synthesis; 4. SPRI clean-up; 5. End Prep; 6. Adapter Ligation; 7. SPRI clean-up + size selection; 8. Barcoding PCR; 9. SPRI clean-up + size selection. \n\nThese protocols are an adaptation of the NEBNext Ultra II RNA Library Preparation (non-directional) Protocol. "
},
