"15,0": {
"v": "\n*FastSelect is designed for removing human rRNA, omit this reagent if not using human derived samples and only incubate at 94\u00b0C and then directly to 4\u00b0C (omit ramping down steps). \n\nMix the master mix and final rxns by pipetting up and down.\n\nThermocycler (heated lid set to 105\u02daC):\n\u00b7       10 seconds** at 94\u00b0C\n\u00b7       2 min 75C\n\u00b7       2 min 70C\n\u00b7       2 min 65C\n\u00b7       2 min 60C\n\u00b7       2 min 55C\n\u00b7       5 min 37C\n\u00b7       5 min 25C\n\u00b7       Hold 4\u00b0C"
},
